  "name": "Raging Grappler (Ex)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As long as the berserker is raging, whenever he succeeds at a check to start a grapple, he can choose to deal damage as if he had also succeeded at a check to maintain the grapple. In addition, while raging, whenever the berserker succeeds at a combat maneuver check to maintain a grapple, he can choose to give himself, the target of his grapple, or both the prone condition as a free action while continuing to maintain the grapple.</p>",
